      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Afton%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Afton boasts three National Register sites: the 1856 Erastus Bolles House, the 1864 Newington Gilbert House, and the 1867 Cushing Hotel.",
